    },
    {
      "displayText": "密阿雷市这座城市\n到处都能见到很多宝可梦！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BC6963F96F75E028FD95EA757CE5E02000A5230590490FD80FD89C152305F88591A5B9D53EF68A6FF0100100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "听说密阿雷是和宝可梦共同生活的城市，\n来这里旅行真是选对地方了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "542C8BF45BC6963F96F7662F548C5B9D53EF68A65171540C751F6D3B768457CE5E02FF0C000A67658FD991CC65C5884C771F662F90095BF9573065B94E86FF0100100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但是啊，\n我们也毫不逊色哦。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F46662F554AFF0C000A62114EEC4E5F6BEB4E0D900A827254E6300200100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我的宝可梦\n一开始是皮宝宝和卷卷耳。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621176845B9D53EF68A6000A4E005F0059CB662F76AE5B9D5B9D548C537753778033300200100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我们一直～都在一起旅行，\n然后它们就进化成了皮皮和长耳兔！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114EEC4E0076F4FF5E90FD57284E008D7765C5884CFF0C000A7136540E5B834EEC5C318FDB531662104E8676AE76AE548C957F80335154FF0100100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这些孩子呀，只有和训练家\n关系非常好才会进化哦！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD94E9B5B695B505440FF0C53EA6709548C8BAD7EC35BB6000A51737CFB975E5E38597D624D4F1A8FDB531654E6FF0100100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "对了！要不要来场宝可梦对战，\n看看我们的关系有多好？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BF94E86FF0189814E0D89816765573A5B9D53EF68A65BF96218FF0C000A770B770B62114EEC768451737CFB6709591A597DFF1F00100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你能打宝可梦对战的话，\n就跟我说一声哦！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F6080FD62535B9D53EF68A65BF9621876848BDDFF0C000A5C318DDF62118BF44E0058F054E6FF0100100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "快来和我、皮皮、长耳兔组成的\n亲密小队对战嘛！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5FEB6765548C6211300176AE76AE3001957F803351547EC462107684000A4EB25BC65C0F961F5BF96218561BFF0100100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "对战！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BF96218FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "还是算了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD8662F7B974E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "唉～真遗憾！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5509FF5E771F905761BEFF0100100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那我们来场友好的对战吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A362114EEC6765573A53CB597D76845BF962185427FF0100100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊～输掉了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 852,
