      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你和宝可梦的关系一定很好，\n跟我们不相上下！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F60548C5B9D53EF68A6768451737CFB4E005B9A5F88597DFF0C000A8DDF62114EEC4E0D76F84E0A4E0BFF0100100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊，差点忘了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "554AFF0C5DEE70B95FD84E86FF0100100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这些孩子们输掉对战\n应该很受打击！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD94E9B5B695B504EEC8F9363895BF96218000A5E948BE55F8853D7625351FBFF0100100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "得像往常一样\n去咖啡馆放松一下才行！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F9750CF5F805E384E006837000A53BB549655619986653E677E4E004E0B624D884CFF0100100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在咖啡馆和宝可梦一起放松！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5728549655619986548C5B9D53EF68A64E008D77653E677EFF0100100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这就是和宝可梦搞好关系的诀窍！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD95C31662F548C5B9D53EF68A6641E597D51737CFB76848BC07A8DFF0100100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
